00:16:29.321 --> 00:16:32.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm just, like, knocking,
knocking -- nothing.

00:16:32.925 --> 00:16:34.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
Finally, because I --
we work togeth--

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:37.596
there's some times where I nee
to talk to him about something

00:16:37.596 --> 00:16:38.664 size:84% position:42% line:92%
