[ Laughter ]

00:16:56.915 --> 00:16:57.750 line:92%
[ Laughing ] Like, we're..

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.385 size:88% position:44%
And there are some times
where you're just like,

00:16:59.385 --> 00:17:01.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
eh, just forget it,
just let it go.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:05.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like, you know,
it just always...

00:17:06.792 --> 00:17:08.861 line:92%
