00:17:47.132 --> 00:17:49.401 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And again, like...

00:17:49.401 --> 00:17:53.605
I've known him for like 20 years
and I've never --

00:17:53.605 --> 00:17:56.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
