00:17:59.845 --> 00:18:00.913 line:92%
Pete, on the other hand --

00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:04.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, we're coming up
on 30 years, Buddy.

00:18:04.483 --> 00:18:06.585 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We have...

00:18:06.585 --> 00:18:09.254 size:81% position:41% line:92%
burgled a lot of hams.

00:18:09.254 --> 00:18:12.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
You, the kind of friend
that I would expect that from.

00:18:12.691 --> 00:18:13.759 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But not Shoemaker.

00:18:13.759 --> 00:18:15.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he goes,
"Maybe I'm proud of you."

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:18.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go,
"What? Really? Why?"

00:18:18.363 --> 00:18:21.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
He goes,"You know, it might no
have been the best movie,

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:24.136 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
but you were in it.

00:18:24.136 --> 00:18:27.439 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
On the big screen.

00:18:27.439 --> 00:18:29.374 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
