00:18:55.934 --> 00:18:57.736 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I think, uh...

00:18:57.736 --> 00:19:00.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think
that's about everything.

00:19:00.172 --> 00:19:00.706 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh!

00:19:00.706 --> 00:19:03.408 line:92%
Uh, [bleep] piss [bleep] fart.

